# Easy Write — Project Conventions

macOS 26+ menu-bar app (`LSUIElement`, no Dock icon), Swift 6 toolchain in Swift 5 language mode, built with Swift Package Manager. Three targets: the `EasyWriteCore` library (pure logic, no AppKit, no FoundationModels), the `EasyWrite` executable, and `EasyWriteCoreTests`. Entry point: `Sources/EasyWrite/main.swift` → `AppDelegate`.

The app translates the clipboard into a popover anchored to the menu-bar icon. Translation runs on Apple's on-device Foundation Models. Requires Apple Silicon and Apple Intelligence at runtime.

